         can reopen each window on its per-window account across relaunch. macOS 14+
         does NOT restore scenes for apps without this key, which left #42's
         selection→presentedAccountID mirror inert. Whether SwiftUI actually restores
         the value-based windows still depends on the "Close windows when quitting"
         system setting + scene storage — needs a manual ⌘Q→relaunch confirmation. -->
